    "body": "Note that implementations don't match this yet, but my rationale is as follows:\r\n\r\n* It doesn't seem right that you can set header values with a U+0000 when neither `XMLHttpRequest` nor `Headers` allow for that.\r\n* If you cannot create such header values, you shouldn't be able to set the event field either. Otherwise you might not notice where things go wrong.",
